#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&khangman; is a game based on the well-known hangman game. It is aimed at "
"children aged six and over. The game has several categories of words to play "
"with and among them: <guimenuitem>Animals</guimenuitem> (animals words) and "
"three difficulty categories: <guimenuitem>Easy</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem>. A "
"word is picked at random, the letters are hidden, and you must guess the "
"word by trying one letter after another. Each time you guess a wrong letter, "
"part of a picture of a hangman is drawn. You must guess the word before "
"being hanged! You have 10 tries."
msgstr ""
"&khangman; je igra bazirana na dobro poznatoj igri vješala. Namijenjena "
"djeci od 6 i više godina. Igra ima nekoliko kategorija riječi uključujući:"
"<guimenuitem>Životinje</guimenuitem> (imena životinja) i tri nivoa težine: "
"<guimenuitem>Lako</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Srednje</guimenuitem> i "
"<guimenuitem>Teško</guimenuitem>. Riječ se nasumično bira, a slova su "
"skrivena, morate pogoditi riječ birajući slovo po slovo. Svako put kada "
"promašite slovo dio slike se nacrta. Morate pogodite riječ prije nego vas "
"objese! Imate 10 pokušaja."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &khangman;"
msgstr "Korištenje &khangman;"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &khangman; when you start it for the first time"
msgstr "Evo kako izgleda  &khangman;  kada ga prvi put pokrenete"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "&khangman; screenshot"
msgstr "&khangman; slika ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can see &khangman; as it is the first time you run it. Category is "
"Animals, language is default (English here, the default is your current "
"&kde; language if the data exists), the theme is \"Sea\". Any changes in "
"category, language or theme (background) are written in the configuration "
"file and restored in your next game."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje vidite &khangman; kada ga prvi put pokrenete. Odabrana je kategorija "
"životinja, jezik je predodređen(Engleski ovdje, predodređeni jezij je "
"maternji &kde; ako postoji takva opcija), a tema je \"More\". Sva promjena "
"kategorije,jezika ili teme(pozadina) je napisana u konfikuracijskom fajlu i "
"pokreće se kada sledeći put igrate."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note how easy it is to change the theme, just click on the combo box "
"on the toolbar. Getting a new word and quitting the game are also easily "
"done by clicking on the corresponding buttons on the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Obrati pažnju na to kako je lako promijeniti temu, samo jednim klikom na "
"kombo kutiji na traci alata. Odabir nove riječi ili prekid igre je isto tako "
"lagan, također samo jedan klik na odgovarajuća dugmad trake alata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "General usage"
msgstr "Generalna upotreba"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A word is chosen and its letters are displayed as an underscore (_) symbol. "
"You know how many letters there are in the word. You have to guess the word "
"by trying one letter after another. You enter the letter in the text box and "
"you either press the &Enter; key or click on the <guibutton>Guess</"
"guibutton> button to see if the letter belongs or not to the word."
msgstr ""
"Kada se riječ odabere slova su prikazana kao crtice(_). Tako znati koliko "
"riječ ima slova. Morate pogoditi riječ pokusavajući slovo po slovo. Unosite "
"slovo u kutiju teksta te pritišćete ili &Enter; tipku ili kliknete na  "
"<guibutton>Pogodi</guibutton> dugme da vidite da li slovo pripada riječi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The word is picked at random and it is not the same as the previous word."
msgstr "Riječ se bira nasumično te je različita od prethodne."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "All the words are nouns (there are no verbs or adjectives, &etc;)."
msgstr "Sve riječi su imenice( nema glagola ili pridjeva,&etc;)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you need help guessing the word, you can click on the <guiicon>Show Hint</"
"guiicon> icon <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"games-"
"hint.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> in the toolbar "
"and a hint will be displayed to give you some clue about the word. Clicking "
"the <guiicon>Show Hint</guiicon> icon again will hide the hint."
msgstr ""
"Ako vam zatreba pomoć, možete kliknuti na  <guiicon>Prikaži Naputak</"
"guiicon> ikonu <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"games-"
"hint.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> na traci alata "
"i naputak će se pojaviti da vam pomogne oko riječi. Ponovno klikanje na "
"<guiicon>Prikaži Naputak</guiicon>  će sakriti naputak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hints are not displayed in default start mode."
msgstr "Naputci se ne prikazuju u predodređenom početnom modu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Usually, it is not important whether you type in lowercase or uppercase. The "
"program converts all input into lowercase (except for German words beginning "
"with an uppercase letter). The program does that automatically."
msgstr ""
"Obično, nije važno da li kucate malim ili velikim slovima. Program mijenja "
"sve unose u mala slova( osim riječi na Njemačkom koje počinju velikim "
"slovom). Program će ovo odraditi za vas automatski."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "The current category, wins and losses are displayed in the statusbar."
msgstr "Kategorija, pobjede i porazi su prikazani na statusnoj liniji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each time you guess a letter that is not in the word, another part of the "
"hangman is drawn. You have 10 tries to guess the word. After that, the "
"correct answer is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Svaki put kada promašite riječ dio slike se nacrta. Imate 10 pokušaja da "
"pogodite riječ. Nakon toga, tačna riječ se pokaže."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are 4 categories: easy, medium, hard and animals, plus categories for "
"other topics in some languages. The program scans for all data files in all "
"languages and uses &kanagram; words files as well."
msgstr ""
"Postoje četiri kategorije: lako, srednje, teško i životinje plus kategorije "
"sa drugim temama na nekim jezicima. Program skenira sve podatke u svim "
"jezicima i koristi &kanagram; fajlove riječi također."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the easy category, the words are quite simple and related to everyday "
"life. It is suitable for children from 6 to 9. The animals category contains "
"only names of animals so they are easier to find. Some of them are easy, "
"others are more difficult. In the medium category, the words are longer and "
"more difficult. It is suitable for ages 9+. The hard category is just that, "
"hard, &ie; the words are difficult to spell and not very well known. This "
"category is challenging, even for adults."
msgstr ""
"U kategoriji lako , riječi su prilično jednostavne i koje se odnose na "
"svakodnevni život . Pogodan je za djecu od 6 do 9. kategoriji životinje "
"sadrži samo imena životinja tako da su lakše pronaći . Neki od njih su "
"jednostavno , drugi su teže . U srednjem kategoriji , riječi su duže i "
"teže . To je pogodan za uzraste 9+ . Čvrsti kategorija je upravo to , "
"teško , i tj ; riječi su teško se piše , a ne vrlo dobro poznat . Ova "
"kategorija predstavlja izazov , čak i za odrasle ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After a word is guessed (or the hangman is completed), you are congratulated "
"and prompted for another word. You can either click on <guilabel>Play again</"
"guilabel> and another word is ready to be guessed or select another "
"<guimenu>Category</guimenu> to play. To quit the game now select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice> or click the <guiicon>Quit</guiicon> icon in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što je riječ završena (ili se pojavio obješeni), dobijate čestitke i "
"bivate pitani za drugu riječ. Možete kliknuti na <guilabel>Igraj ponovo</"
"guilabel> i druga riječ je spremna za pogađanje ili možete odabrati drugu "
"<guimenu>Kategoriju</guimenu> za igru. Da napustite igru odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Igra</guimenu><guimenuitem>Izlaz</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice> ili kliknite <guiicon>Izlaz</guiicon> ikonu na alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You type the letter you want to try in the text box (the mouse cursor is "
"ready in the text box) and you hit the &Enter; key or click the "
"<guibutton>Guess</guibutton> button. If the letter belongs to the word, it "
"takes its place, as many times as it appears in the word. If the letter does "
"not belong to the word, it goes in the <guilabel>Misses</guilabel> field and "
"a further part of the hangman is drawn on the right. You have ten tries and "
"after that you lose and the correct word is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Vi upišite slovo koje želite probati u okvir za tekst ( kursor miša je "
"spremna u okvir za tekst ) i pogodio &Enter; taster ili kliknite na  "
"<guibutton> Pogodi</guibutton> . Ako pismo pripada riječ , ona svoje mjesto "
"zauzima , onoliko puta koliko se pojavljuje u riječi. Ako pismo ne pripada "
"riječ , ide u <guilabel>Promašaji </guilabel> polje i dalje dio Vješala se "
"izvući na desnoj strani. Imate deset pokušaja , a nakon toga gubite i riječ "
"je prikazana."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"During the game, you can choose to start a new game by going in the "
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu> menu and choosing <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem> or "
"clicking on the <guiicon>New</guiicon> icon <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"document-new.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></"
"inlinemediaobject> on the toolbar. You can also change the category of words "
"using the <guimenu>Category</guimenu> menu (this will bring you a new word "
"for the new category)."
msgstr ""
"Tokom igre, možete odabrati da pokrenete novu igru odlaskom u meni "
"<guimenu>Igra</guimenu> i izborom <guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem> ili klikom "
"na <guiicon>Nova</guiicon> ikonu <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"document-new.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></"
"inlinemediaobject> na alatnoj traci. Možete promijeniti i kategoriju riječi "
"koristeći <guimenu>Kategorija</guimenu> meni (to će vam donijeti novu riječ "
"za novu kategoriju)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The look can easily be changed with the <guimenuitem>Look</guimenuitem> "
"toolbar holding the look dropdown box."
msgstr ""
"Izgled se lako može promijeniti s <guimenuitem> Pogledajte </guimenuitem>  "
"alatnu traku držeći pogled padajućeg izbornika ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guiicon>Quit</guiicon> button on the toolbar "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"application-exit.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> allows you to easily quit "
"the game."
msgstr ""
"The <guiicon> Prekini </guiicon> gumb na alatnoj traci  "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"application-exit.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> vam omogućava da lako "
"otkaz igri ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also play the game with a local file installed on your machine that "
"you will open using the <guimenu>Game</guimenu> menu and choosing "
"<guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Također možete igrati igru ​​s lokalnim datoteku instaliran na vašem stroju "
"koji će se otvoriti pomoću <guimenu> Game </guimenu> izbornika i odabirom "
"<guimenuitem> Otvori</guimenuitem> ."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "Playing in different languages"
msgstr "Igranje na različitim jezicima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can play &khangman; in many languages including: Brazilian Portuguese, "
"Bulgarian, Catalan, Czech, Danish, Dutch, English (US and GB), Finnish, "
"French, German, Hungarian, Irish (Gaelic), Italian, Norwegian (Bokm&#229;l), "
"Norwegian (Nynorsk), Polish, Portuguese, Romanian, Spanish, Serbian (Latin "
"and Cyrillic), Slovenian, Tajik, Swedish, Russian and Turkish. You can even "
"try Chinese if you install the files from &kanagram;!!"
msgstr ""
"Možete igrati &khangman;  na mnogim jezicima uključujući : brazilski "
"portugalski, bugarski, katalonski, češki, danski, nizozemski, engleski (SAD "
"i GB), finski, francuski, njemački, mađarski, irski (galski), talijanski, "
"norveški (Bokm&#229;l), norveški (Nynorsk), poljski, portugalski, rumunjski, "
"španski, srpski ( latinica i ćirilica ), slovenački, Tajik, švedski, ruski i "
"turski . Možete čak i pokušati kineski ako instalirate datoteke iz "
"&kanagram; !!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, after the first installation of &khangman;, only English and "
"your &kde; language if it is one of the above and if you have the "
"corresponding kde-i18n package will be installed. For example if you are a "
"Danish user and if you have &kde; in Danish, in <guimenu>Language</guimenu> "
"you will see two items: English and Danish and Danish will be the default."
msgstr ""
"Po defaultu , nakon prve instalacije i khangman ;, samo na engleskom i tvoj "
"i kde ; jezika ako je jedan od gore , a ako imate odgovarajući kde - 18n "
"paket će biti instaliran . Na primjer, ako ste danski korisnik i ako imate i "
"kde ; na danskom , u <guimenu> Jezik </guimenu> vidjet ćete dvije stavke : "
"engleski i danski i danski će biti default ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can still play &khangman; in other languages. It is very easy to add new "
"data in &khangman;. All you need is a working Internet connection. You click "
"on the <guimenu>Game</guimenu> menu and then on <guimenuitem>Get Words in "
"New Language...</guimenuitem>. A dialog appears, similar to this one:"
msgstr ""
"Još uvijek možete igrati &khangman; na drugim jezicima . To je vrlo lako za "
"dodavanje novih podataka u &khangman;. Sve što je potrebno je aktivnu "
"Internet vezu . Kliknite na <guimenu> Game </guimenu>  meniju, a zatim na "
"<guimenuitem> Dobavi riječi u novom jeziku ... </guimenuitem> . Pojavljuje "
"se dijalog , sličan ovome :"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Get New Words dialog for &khangman;</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> Dijalog &khangman; za nove riječi</screeninfo >"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Get New Words dialog for &khangman;</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dijalog za dobavljanje novih riječi za &khangman;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the language name you want to install and then on the "
"<guibutton>Install</guibutton> button. If the language is successfully "
"installed, a green tick is displayed in front of the language name and the "
"<guibutton>Install</guibutton> turns to <guibutton>Uninstall</guibutton>. "
"The data is immediately installed and available in &khangman;. You click on "
"the <guibutton>Close</guibutton> button to close the Get New Words dialog "
"(if you want another data file, you can repeat these steps)."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na ime jezik koji želite instalirati , a zatim na <guibutton> "
"Instaliraj </guibutton> . Ako je uspješno instaliran jezik , zelena oznaka "
"je prikazana ispred imena jezika i <guibutton> Instaliraj </guibutton > "
"postaje <guibutton>Deinstaliraj</guibutton>. Podaci su odmah instalirani i "
"dostupni u &khangman;. Kliknite na <guibutton>Zatvori</guibutton> da biste "
"zatvorili dijalog za dobavljanje novih riječi (ako želite drugu datoteku "
"podataka, možete ponoviti ove korake)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can then easily change the language by going in the <guimenu>Language</"
"guimenu> and choose the new language."
msgstr ""
"Zatim možete jednostavno promijeniti jezik odlaskom u <guimenu> Jezik </"
"guimenu> i odaberite novi jezik ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note that you can now type the special characters in a language by "
"displaying the <interface>Special Characters</interface> toolbar. This "
"toolbar holds buttons with an icon of each special character per language "
"like &eacute; in French for example. Clicking on such a button will write "
"the corresponding letter in the input line and you validate your choice with "
"&Enter;. You can of course also use the keyboard layout corresponding to the "
"language. This toolbar can be shown or hidden. The setting is restored next "
"time you play &khangman;."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da sada možete upisati posebne znakove na jeziku prikazivanjem "
"<interface>Specijalni znakovi</interface> alatna traka . Ova alatna traka "
"ima tipke sa ikonom svakog posebnog karaktera po jeziku , kao  &eacute; na "
"francuskom jeziku na primjer . Klikom na gumb takav će napisati odgovarajuće "
"slovo u ulaznu liniju i potvrdite svoj ​​izbor s &Enter;. Naravno, možete "
"koristiti i raspored tastature odgovara jezika . Ova alatna traka može se "
"prikazati ili sakriti . Postavka se vraća sljedeći put igrate &khangman;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note that you need Arial and URW Bookman fonts in order to display "
"the special characters correctly in some languages. Provided you have those "
"fonts installed, &khangman; will automatically use them. If you see small "
"squares instead of letters, then you may not have one of these fonts "
"installed. Type <command>fonts:/</command> into the &konqueror; address bar "
"to check which fonts you have installed."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da trebate Arial i URW Bookman fontove kako bi prikazali "
"posebne znakove ispravno u nekim jezicima . Ukoliko imate te fontove "
"instalirane, &khangman; će ih automatski koristiti. Ako vidite male kvadrate "
"umjesto slova, onda nemate jedan od ovih fontova instaliranih. Unesite "
"<command>fonts:/</command> u &konqueror; adresu bar da provjerite koji su "
"fontovi koje ste instalirali."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "A few tips"
msgstr "Nekoliko tipova"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In English, try to guess the vowels first. Then have a go with the most "
"common consonants: l, t, r, n, s"
msgstr ""
"Na engleskom , pokušajte prvo pogoditi samoglasnika . Zatim su odem s "
"najčešćim suglasnika : l, t , r, n , s"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you see <quote>io</quote>, try n after that, in French and English."
msgstr ""
"Kada vidite <quote> IO </quote> , pokušajte n nakon toga , na francuskom i "
"engleskom jeziku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In Brazilian Portuguese, Catalan, Spanish and Portuguese, the accented "
"vowels can be discovered when you type the non accented corresponding vowel. "
"For example, all the accented <quote>a</quote> are displayed in the word "
"when you type <quote>a</quote>. This is when <guilabel>Type accented "
"letters</guilabel> on the <guilabel>Languages</guilabel> page of "
"&khangman;'s configuration dialog is not checked. When <guilabel>Type "
"accented letters</guilabel> is checked, then you have to type the accented "
"letters yourself. When you type <quote>a</quote>, only <quote>a</quote> is "
"displayed and you have to type for example &atilde; for this letter to be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"U brazilskom portugalskom, katalonskom, španskom i portugalskom, naglašeni "
"samoglasnik se može otkriti kada upišete koje nenaglašeni odgovarajući "
"samoglasnik. Na primjer, svi akcentovani <quote>a</quote> su prikazani u "
"riječi kada upišete <quote>a</quote>. To se dešava kada je <guilabel>Kucaj "
"slova s akcentima</guilabel> na <guilabel>Jezici</guilabel> stranici "
"&khangman; konfiguracijskog dijaloga nije uključen. Kada je <guilabel>Kucaj "
"slova s naglascima</guilabel> uključeno, onda morate kucati na slova s "
"naglascima sami. Kada upišete <quote>a</quote> samo <quote>a</quote> se "
"prikazuje i morate kucati na primjer &atilde; za ovo slovo da se prikaže."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Did you know? In English, the most common letter is e (12.7%), followed by t "
"(9.1%) then a (8.2%), i (7.0%) and n (6.7%)."
msgstr ""
"Jeste li znali? Na engleskom , najčešći slovo je e ( 12,7% ) , zatim t "
"( 9,1% ) zatim ( 8,2% ) , i ( 7,0% ) i n ( 6,7% ) ."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menubar and toolbars"
msgstr "Meni i alatne trake"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Main &khangman; Window"
msgstr "Glavni &khangman; prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Game</guimenu> menu has 3 items: <guimenuitem>New</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Get Words in New Language...</guimenuitem> and "
"<guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Meni <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> ima 3 stavke : <guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Dobavi riječi u novi jezik... </guimenuitem> i "
"<guimenuitem>Izlaz</guimenuitem> ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem> brings you a new game, &ie; a new word to "
"guess, in the same category you already are. <guimenuitem>Get Words in New "
"Language...</guimenuitem> will display the Get New Stuff dialog to allow you "
"to download data in a new language. <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem> quits "
"the game by closing the main window and writing the actual settings in the "
"configuration file."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem> Novi </guimenuitem> vam donosi novu igru ​​, i tj ; novu riječ "
"pogoditi , u istoj kategoriji već su . <guimenuitem> Get Riječi u New "
"Language ... </guimenuitem> će se prikazati Get dijalog nove stvari koji vam "
"omogućuju da preuzmete podatke u novi jezik . <guimenuitem> Prekini </"
"guimenuitem> odustane igre zatvaranjem glavnog prozora i pisanje stvarne "
"postavke u konfiguracijskoj datoteci ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Category</guimenu> menu allows you to choose the category of "
"words you want to play with and also three difficulty categories."
msgstr ""
"Meni <guimenu>Kategorija</guimenu> omogućava vam da odaberete kategoriju "
"riječi sa kojim želite igrati i tri težine kategorije ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Language</guimenu> menu allows you to change the language the "
"words are displayed in."
msgstr ""
"Meni <guimenu> Jezik </guimenu> vam omogućava da promijenite jezik u kome se "
"riječi prikazuju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Look</guimenu> menu proposes four themes: the <guimenuitem>Sea "
"Theme</guimenuitem>, the <guimenuitem>Winter Theme</guimenuitem>, the "
"<guimenuitem>Bee Theme</guimenuitem> and the <guimenuitem>Desert Theme</"
"guimenuitem>. The background and the font colors change for each theme."
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Izgled</guimenu> predlaže četiri teme : u <guimenuitem>Morska Tema "
"</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Zimska tema </guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Pčelinja Tema </guimenuitem> i <guimenuitem>Pustinjska Tema </"
"guimenuitem>. Pozadina i boja fonta mijenja se za svaku temu ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu allows you to configure &khangman; "
"easily. First, <guimenuitem>Toolbars</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Show Hint</"
"guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Show Statusbar</guimenuitem> give you the "
"possibility to hide or show the toolbars, hints and the statusbar."
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> omogućuje konfiguriranje &khangman; lako. Prvo, "
"<guimenuitem>Alatne trake</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Prikaži savjet</"
"guimenuitem> i <guimenuitem>Prikaži Statusnu traku</guimenuitem> daju vam "
"mogućnost da sakrije ili prikazati alatnu traku, savjete i statusnu traku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are four toolbars: the <guimenuitem>Main</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Look</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Language</guimenuitem> "
"toolbars which are the one on top with the buttons and combo boxes and the "
"<guilabel>Special Characters</guilabel> toolbar which, when it is shown, is "
"on the bottom. This toolbar has buttons with the special characters for each "
"language: accented letters and other special characters. This allows users "
"to easily play in another language without having to configure a new "
"keyboard layout. You click on a special letter and it is displayed as the "
"letter to try. Pressing &Enter; will make the program see if the letter is "
"present in the word or not. The toolbar can be hidden if you don't want it. "
"This is saved in the configuration file so if the toolbar is hidden, it will "
"be hidden next time you run &khangman;."
msgstr ""
"Postoje četiri alatne trake : alatne trake <guimenuitem>Glavni</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Pogled</guimenuitem> i <guimenuitem>Jezik</"
"guimenuitem> su na vrhu sa dugmadima i kombo okvirima, dok je alatna traka "
"<guilabel>Specijalni znakovi</guilabel> prikazana na dnu . Ova alatna traka "
"ima tipke sa posebnim znakovima za svaki jezik: slova s naglascima i druge "
"posebne znakove. To omogućuje korisnicima da lako igraju na nekom drugom "
"jeziku, bez potrebe da konfigurirati novi raspored tastature. Kliknete na "
"posebno slovo ,a ono se prikazuje kao slovo pokušaja. Pritiskom &Enter; će "
"program vidjeti da li je slovo prisutno u riječi ili ne. Alatne trake možete "
"sakriti ako ih ne želite. To se čuva u konfiguracijskoj datoteci pa ako je "
"alatna traka skrivena, ona se neće prikazati sljedeći put kada pokrenete "
"&khangman; ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is of course possible to move the toolbars around. Put the mouse cursor "
"on the small handle on the left of the toolbar, press the &LMB; and drag the "
"toolbar to position it on the screen where you want it. If you point the "
"mouse on one of the toolbars and press the right mouse button, a context "
"menu appears to let you choose different options for the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Naravno, moguće je pomijerati alatne trake. Stavite kursor miša na ručicu na "
"lijevoj strani alatne trake, pritisnite &LMB; pa povucite alatnu traku kako "
"biste je postavili na ekranu gdje želite. Ako usmjerite miša na jednoj od "
"alatne trake i pritisnete desnu tipku miša, pojavljuje se kontekst izborniku "
"da odaberete različite opcije za alatne trake."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:375
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem> is a standard &kde; "
"setting dialog that allows you to choose different shortcut keys for "
"different actions. For example, <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</"
"keycap></keycombo> is the standard shortcut for <guimenuitem>Quit</"
"guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Podesi prečice ... </guimenuitem> je Standardni &kde; dijalog "
"koji vam omogućuje da odaberete različite tipke prečaca za različite akcije "
"postavljanje . Na primjer , <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</"
"keycap></keycombo> je standardna prečica za <guimenuitem>Izlaz</"
"guimenuitem> ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem> is also a standard &kde; "
"menu item that allows you to add or suppress items from the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Konfiguriši alatne trake... </guimenuitem> je standardna stavka "
"&kde; menija koja vam omogućuje da dodate ili potisnuti stavke iz alatne "
"trake ."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:385
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&khangman; Desert theme</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&khangman; Pustinjska tema </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&khangman; Desert theme</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&khangman; Pustinjska tema </phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you have &khangman; with the Desert theme, French language and category "
"Easy. The <interface>Special Characters</interface> toolbar is shown here."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje imate &khangman; s pustinjskom temom, francuski jezik i kategorija "
"Lagano. Ovdje je prikazana alatna traka <interface>Specijalni znakovi</"
"interface> ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:401
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The category is chosen with a combo box in the toolbar or via the "
"<guimenu>Category</guimenu> menu in the menubar. Available are "
"<guimenuitem>Easy</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Animals</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem> and "
"some more. <guimenuitem>Easy</guimenuitem> is related to common objects a "
"child aged six or seven knows. <guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem> regards "
"nouns a bit more challenging, <guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem> is quite "
"difficult and <guimenuitem>Animals</guimenuitem> is only animals nouns. "
"There are also some other categories of words, depending on the language."
msgstr ""
"Kategorija je izabrana sa kombo okvirom na alatnoj traci ili preko <guimenu> "
"Kategorija</guimenu> u menuiju. Dostupni su <guimenuitem>Lako</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Srednje</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Životinje</guimenuitem> i "
"<guimenuitem>Teško</guimenuitem> i još neke. <guimenuitem>Lako</guimenuitem> "
"se odnosi na zajedničke objekte koje dijete u dobi od šest ili sedam godina "
"zna. <guimenuitem>Srednje</guimenuitem>obuhvata imenice koje su malo veći "
"izazov, <guimenuitem>Teško</guimenuitem> je prilično teško a "
"<guimenuitem>Životinje</guimenuitem> su samo vrste životinja. Tu su i još "
"neke druge kategorije riječi, ovisno o jeziku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All words are nouns. No verbs, no adjectives. The chosen category is then "
"displayed on the statusbar."
msgstr ""
"Sve riječi su imenice . Bez glagola , pridjeva nema . Izabrani kategoriji se "
"zatim prikazuje na statusbar ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only letters are allowed to be typed in the text box."
msgstr "Samo slova dozvoljeno da se upisali u okvir za tekst ."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:420
#, no-c-format
msgid "Available Settings"
msgstr "Dostupne postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A toolbar is provided for quick access to some settings. You can click on a "
"button to have a new game (i.e. a new word), to see the hint or to quit the "
"game. The theme is easily changed via a combo box on the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"A alatna traka je predviđeno za brzi pristup neke postavke . Možete kliknuti "
"na gumb imati novu igru ​​( tj nova reč ) , da vide nagovještaj ili napustiti "
"igru . Tema je lako promeniti preko kombinirani okvir na alatnoj traci ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure "
"&khangman;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> you will find tree pages. The "
"first one is for <guilabel>General</guilabel> settings."
msgstr ""
"U <menuchoice> <guimenu> Postavke </guimenu> <guimenuitem> Konfiguracija "
"&khangman; ... </guimenuitem> </menuchoice> ćete naći drvo stranice . Prvi "
"je za <guilabel> General </guilabel> postavke."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Opšte postavke"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:436
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&khangman; General settings</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> &khangman; Opće postavke </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:442
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&khangman; General settings</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&khangman; Opće postavke</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Require more guesses for duplicate letters</guilabel>: this is "
"unchecked as default. When unchecked, if you try the letter \"a\" and the "
"word has several as, they will be all displayed. For example if the word is "
"\"potato\" and you try \"o\", both os will be diaplayed. If you check this "
"option however, only the first \"o\" will be displayed and you will have to "
"try it one more time to display the second \"o\" in \"potato\". This "
"increases the difficulty."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Zahtijevaj više pogađanja za duplim slovima </guilabel>: ovo nije "
"normalno označena. Kada nije označeno, ako pokušate slovo \"a\", a riječ ih "
"ima nekoliko, sva će biti prikazans. Na primjer, ako je riječ \"potomak\" , "
"a vi pokušate \"o\" , oba o će biti prikazana. Ako označite ovu opciju, "
"međutim , samo prvi \"o\" će se prikazati, a vi ćete morati da ga pokušate "
"još jednom za prikaz drugog \"o\" u \"potomak\". To povećava teškoću."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Enable animations</guilabel>: the default is checked, that means "
"that when you win a game, a message box will be displayed to tell you that "
"you won and ask you if you want to play again. If you uncheck this option, "
"this dialog is not displayed anymore, instead a new game starts directly "
"after 3 seconds."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Uključi animacije</guilabel>: normalno je uključeno, to znači da "
"kad ste osvojili igru, poruka će se prikazati da kaže da ste pobijedili i "
"pita da li želite da ponovo igrati. Ako isključite ovu opciju, ovaj dijalog "
"se više ne prikazuje ,a umjesto toga nova igra počinje odmah nakon 3 "
"sekunde ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Enable hints globally</guilabel>: the default is unchecked. Hints "
"are not shown. If you check this (or use the <guilabel>Show Hints</guilabel> "
"icon or the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Hint</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu or use the shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo>), a hint will be displayed above the "
"word to guess to help you find the word more easily."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Uključi savjete globalno </guilabel>: normalno je isključeno. "
"Savjeti nisu prikazani. Ako označite ovo (ili koristite <guilabel>savjeti</"
"guilabel> ikonu ili <menuchoice> <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Prikaži savjet</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> meni ili koristiti "
"prečicu <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo>), "
"savjet će se prikazati iznad riječ koju pogađate da vam pomogne da lakše "
"nađete riječi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:471
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Sounds</guilabel> section, if you check <guilabel>Enable "
"sounds</guilabel> then a sound will be played on new game and another sound "
"will be played when you win a game."
msgstr ""
"U <guilabel> Zvuci </guilabel> , ako provjerite <guilabel> Omogući zvukove </"
"guilabel > onda zvuk će se igrati na novu igru ​​, a drugi zvuk će se igrati "
"kada pobijediti igra."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:479
#, no-c-format
msgid "Languages Settings"
msgstr "Postavke Jezika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:480
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Languages</guilabel> Settings tab allows you to set some "
"settings specific to some languages. If the settings are not available for "
"the language you are playing in then those settings will be grayed and "
"disabled so you cannot choose them."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel> Jezici ​</guilabel> postavke vam omogućava da postaviti neke "
"postavke specifične za nekim jezicima. Ako nisu dostupni za jezik koji ste "
"se igrajući onda te postavke će biti sivi i osobe s invaliditetom postavke "
"tako da ne možete ih odabrati ."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:487
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&khangman; Languages Settings</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&khangman; Jezičke postavke </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:493
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&khangman; Languages Settings</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&khangman; Jezici Postavke</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:498
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Type accented letters</guilabel> is available for Spanish, "
"Portuguese and Catalan in &khangman;'s configuration dialog. If you check "
"<guilabel>Type accented letters</guilabel> then you will have to type all "
"accented vowels (like &atilde;). If this remains unchecked, when you type "
"any vowel, all accented vowels will be displayed as well."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kucanje slova s ​​naglascima </guilabel> je dostupna za španjolski, "
"portugalski i katalonski u &khangman;  dijalogu konfiguracije. Ako označite "
"<guilabel>Kucanje slova s ​​naglascima </guilabel> onda ćete morati kucati sve "
"akcene samoglasnika ( kao što je &atilde; ) . Ako to nije označeno, kad "
"ukucate neki samoglasnik, svi akcentovani samoglasnici će se takođe "
"prikazati ."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid "Timers Settings"
msgstr "Postavke Tajmera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:509
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Timers</guilabel> Settings tab allows you to set "
"<guilabel>Time for displaying the Already Guessed Letter tooltip</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel >Tajmeri</guilabel>Kartica postavki omogućuje vam da postavite "
"<guilabel> Vrijeme je za prikaz već pretpostavljenih savjeta slova</"
"guilabel> ."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:514
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&khangman; Timers Settings</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> &khangman; postavke tajmera</screeninfo >"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:520
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&khangman; Timers Settings</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&khangman; Postavke tajmera</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:525
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Time for displaying the Already Guessed Letter tooltip</guilabel> "
"allows you to increase or decrease the time for displaying the Already "
"Guessed Letter tooltip. This tooltip is a label which appears when you tried "
"a letter that was already tried. Some people will want not to see it for "
"long while children will need time to understand it and thus will need to "
"set the display for a longer duration."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Vrijeme za prikazivanje savjeta već pogađanih slova</guilabel> vam "
"omogućava da povećate ili smanjite vrijeme za prikazivanje već pogađanih "
"slova . Ovaj savjet je oznaka koja se pojavljuje kada ste pokušali slovo "
"koje je već pokušano . Neki ljudi će željeti da to ne vide dugo , dok će "
"djeca trebato vremena da shvate da i na taj način će trebati postaviti "
"prikaz na duže trajanje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:540
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Reference"
msgstr "Reference za naredbe"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:543
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menus and Shortcut Keys"
msgstr "Tipke Menija i Kratica"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:546
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Game Menu"
msgstr "Meni Igre"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
