"ulink> iz &kde; Osnova."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:708
#, no-c-format
msgid "Developer's Guide to &khangman;"
msgstr "Vodič za &khangman; za divelopere;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:711
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to translate words in a new language for the game"
msgstr "Kako prevesti riječi na novi jezik za igru"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:713
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please follow the procedure and then send me the files tarred and gzipped to "
"&Anne-Marie.Mahfouf.mail;."
msgstr ""
"Molim vas pratite odgovarajuču proceduru te pošaljute mi fajkove koju su "
"tarred-ovani i gzippovani na &Anne-Marie.Mahfouf.mail;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:716
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please have a look in &khangman; <guimenuitem>Get Words in New Language...</"
"guimenuitem> in the <guimenu>Game</guimenu> menu to see if your language is "
"available yet. If it is, then you can check if it contains <emphasis>hints</"
"emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Molim vas vidite u  &khangman; <guimenuitem>Dodaj nove riječi u jezik...</"
"guimenuitem>u<guimenu>Igra</guimenu>meniju da vidite da li je jezik "
"dostupan. Ako jeste, pogledajte da li sarži <emphasis>naputke</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:722
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The standard list words are stored in 4 separate files, so to make different "
"categories. The files are in <filename class=\"directory\">/khangman/data/</"
"filename>. The file <filename>easy.kvtml</filename> is for category easy, "
"the file <filename>medium.kvtml</filename> is for category medium, the file "
"<filename>animals.kvtml</filename> is for category animals and the file "
"<filename>hard.kvtml</filename> is for category hard."
msgstr ""
"Standardna lista riječi se čuva u 4 odvojena fajla, tako da čini 4 "
"kategorije. Fajlovi su u <filename class=\"directory\">/khangman/data/</"
"filename>. The file <filename>easy.kvtml</filename> za kategoriju lako, "
"fajl<filename>medium.kvtml</filename> za srednje, fajl  <filename>animals."
"kvtml</filename> za kategoriju životinje i fajl <filename>hard.kvtml</"
"filename> za kategoriju teško."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:729
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"English is the default and thus the only language to be shipped with "
"&khangman;. All other languages data are put in the corresponding kde-l10n "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Engleski je predefinisani i samim tim jedini jezik za izvoz sa &khangman;. "
"Svi drugi podatci o drugim jezicima se šalju na odgovarajući  kde-l10n modul."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:735
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The files use the kvtml format. The tag <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">text</"
"sgmltag> is for the word and the tag <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">comment</"
"sgmltag> is for the hint, those are within a <sgmltag class=\"starttag"
"\">entry</sgmltag> tag. Please try to match the hint with the category of "
"difficulty. The category <guimenuitem>Easy</guimenuitem> will require an "
"easy hint but the category <guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem> will require the "
"definition in the dictionary. Try not to use words of the same family in the "
"hint, that would give the word away too easily!"
msgstr ""
"Datoteke koriste format kvtml . Oznaka<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">tekst</"
"sgmltag>je za riječ, a oznaka <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">comment</sgmltag> "
"je za savjet, oni su unutar<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">entry</sgmltag> "
"oznake . Pokušajte da usaglasite savjet sa kategorijom teškoće. U kategoriji "
"<guimenuitem> Easy </guimenuitem> će zahtijevati lagan hint , ali kategoriji "
"<guimenuitem> Hard </guimenuitem> će zahtijevati definiciju u rječniku. "
"Pokušajte da ne koriste riječi iste porodice u nagovještaj , da će dati "
"riječ dalje previše lako !"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:745
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that you must use <emphasis role=\"bold\">UTF-8 encoding</emphasis> "
"when editing the files. If your editor cannot do this, try using &kwrite; or "
"&kate;. When opening a file in &kwrite; or &kate; you can select utf8 "
"encoding with the combo box at the top of the file open dialog."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da morate koristiti <emphasis role=\"bold\">UTF-8 kodiranje</"
"emphasis> prilikom uređivanja datoteke . Ako vaš editor ne može ovo , "
"pokušajte koristeći &kwrite; ili &kate;. Prilikom otvaranja datoteke u "
"&kwrite; ili &kate; možete odabrati utf8 encoding sa combo box na vrhu "
"otvorenog dijaloga datoteku ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:750
#, no-c-format
msgid "An example of a kvtml file is as follow:"
msgstr "Primjer kvtml datoteke je kako slijedi :"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:751
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<markup>\n"
"&lt;?xml version=\"1.0\"?&gt; \n"
"&lt;DOCTYPE kvtml PUBLIC \"kvtml2.dtd\"\n"
"\"http://edu.kde.org/kanagram/kvtml2.dtd\"&gt; \n"
"&lt;kvtml version=\"2.0\"&gt; \n"
"&lt;information&gt;\n"
"    &lt;generator&gt;converter&lt;/generator&gt;\n"
"    &lt;title&gt;Animals&lt;/title&gt;&lt;!--Translate tag content--&gt;\n"
"    &lt;comment&gt;Animals from across the\n"
"planet&lt;/comment&gt;&lt;!--Translate tag content--&gt;\n"
"  &lt;/information&gt;\n"
"  &lt;identifiers&gt;\n"
"    &lt;identifier id=\"0\" &gt;\n"
"      &lt;locale&gt;en&lt;/locale&gt;\n"
"    &lt;/identifier&gt;\n"
"  &lt;/identifiers&gt;\n"
"...\n"
"&lt;entry id=\"0\" &gt;\n"
"      &lt;inactive&gt;false&lt;/inactive&gt;\n"
"      &lt;inquery&gt;false&lt;/inquery&gt;\n"
"      &lt;translation id=\"0\" &gt;\n"
"        &lt;text&gt;bear&lt;/text&gt;&lt;!--Translate all text tags\n"
"content--&gt;\n"
"        &lt;comment&gt;Large heavy animal with thick\n"
"fur&lt;/comment&gt;&lt;!--Translate all comment tags content--&gt;\n"
"      &lt;/translation&gt;\n"
"    &lt;/entry&gt;\n"
"...\n"
"&lt;/kvtml&gt;\n"
"</markup>"
msgstr ""
"<markup>\n"
"&lt;?xml version=\"1.0\"?&gt; \n"
"&lt;DOCTYPE kvtml PUBLIC \"kvtml2.dtd\"\n"
"\"http://edu.kde.org/kanagram/kvtml2.dtd\"&gt; \n"
"&lt;kvtml version=\"2.0\"&gt; \n"
"&lt;information&gt;\n"
"    &lt;generator&gt;converter&lt;/generator&gt;\n"
"    &lt;title&gt;Animals&lt;/title&gt;&lt;!--Translate tag content--&gt;\n"
"    &lt;comment&gt;Animals from across the\n"
"planet&lt;/comment&gt;&lt;!--Translate tag content--&gt;\n"
"  &lt;/information&gt;\n"
"  &lt;identifiers&gt;\n"
"    &lt;identifier id=\"0\" &gt;\n"
"      &lt;locale&gt;en&lt;/locale&gt;\n"
"    &lt;/identifier&gt;\n"
"  &lt;/identifiers&gt;\n"
"...\n"
"&lt;entry id=\"0\" &gt;\n"
"      &lt;inactive&gt;false&lt;/inactive&gt;\n"
"      &lt;inquery&gt;false&lt;/inquery&gt;\n"
"      &lt;translation id=\"0\" &gt;\n"
"        &lt;text&gt;bear&lt;/text&gt;&lt;!--Translate all text tags\n"
"content--&gt;\n"
"        &lt;comment&gt;Large heavy animal with thick\n"
"fur&lt;/comment&gt;&lt;!--Translate all comment tags content--&gt;\n"
"      &lt;/translation&gt;\n"
"    &lt;/entry&gt;\n"
"...\n"
"&lt;/kvtml&gt;\n"
"</markup>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:754
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the beginning of the file, you should translate the content of the "
"<sgmltag class=\"starttag\">title</sgmltag> and the <sgmltag class=\"starttag"
"\">comment</sgmltag> tags which are within the <sgmltag class=\"starttag"
"\">information</sgmltag> tag. The title will be the one that will appear in "
"the Category menu of the game (where the user chooses the file to play with)."
msgstr ""
"Na početku datoteke , trebalo bi prevesti sadržaj <sgmltag class=\" starttag"
"\" > naslov </sgmltag> i <sgmltag class=\"starttag\"> komentar </sgmltag > "
"oznake koje su unutar  <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">information</sgmltag> . "
"Naslov će biti onaj koji će se pojaviti u izborniku Kategorija igre ( u "
"kojoj korisnik odabere datoteku s kojom se igra ) ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:763
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Then within the <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">identifier</sgmltag> tag, please "
"put your language code instead of en in <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">locale</"
"sgmltag>."
msgstr ""
"Onda, unutar <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">identifikator</sgmltag> oznake, "
"molim stavite vaš jezički kod umjesto  en u <sgmltag class=\"starttag"
"\">locale</sgmltag>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:767
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please don't translate the file name itself as filenames should never "
"contain any special characters. Thus please save your file with the same "
"English filename."
msgstr ""
"Molimo vas da ne prevede naziv datoteke jer imena nikada datoteke ne treba "
"da sadrži nikakve posebne znakove . Stoga molimo sačuvajte datoteku s istim "
"kao engleska datoteka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:772
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Edit the kvtml files with a text editor (it will be easier if you use the "
"&XML; syntax highlighting) and replace each word inside the <sgmltag class="
"\"starttag\">text</sgmltag> tag with a translated word and each hint inside "
"a <sgmltag class=\"starttag\">comment</sgmltag> with a translated hint. It "
"is not really important that the exact meaning is preserved, but try to keep "
"the length and category of difficulty roughly the same."
msgstr ""
"Uredite kvtml datoteke s uređivač teksta ( to će biti lakše ako koristite "
"&XML; isticanje sintakse ) i zamijeniti svake riječi unutar <sgmltag class ="
"\"starttag\"> tekst </sgmltag > tag sa prevedene riječi , a svaki hint "
"unutar a <sgmltag class=\"starttag\"> komentar </sgmltag> sa prevedene "
"hint . To zapravo nije važno da se tačno značenje je očuvan , ali pokušajte "
"zadržati dužine i kategoriju poteškoća otprilike isti ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:781
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can include words with white space or - in them, in that case the white "
"space or the - will be shown instead of the _. Please contact me if there is "
"anything special related to your language so I can adapt the code to it "
"(especially the special and accented characters)."
msgstr ""
"Možete uključiti riječi sa bijelim prostorom ili - u njima , u tom slučaju "
"bijeli prostor ili - će biti prikazan umjesto _ . Molimo vas da me "
"kontaktirate ako postoji nešto posebno u vašem ​​jeziku , tako da mogu "
"prilagoditi kod za to ( posebno specijalne i znakove s akcentom ) ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:789
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can just translate the words but you can also adapt them following the "
"category and add new words if you want. For example, <quote>table</quote> is "
"in category easy in English but in your language, it can be category medium. "
"Feel free to adapt the files to your language needs. The number of words in "
"a file is not important, you can add some if you want."
msgstr ""
"Možete samo da prevesti riječi , ali ih možete prilagoditi sljedeće "
"kategorije i dodavati nove riječi ako želite . Na primjer , <quote> table  </"
"quote> spada u kategoriju lako na engleskom jeziku , ali u svoj ​​jezik, to "
"može biti kategoriji srednje . Slobodno prilagoditi datoteke Vašim potrebama "
"jeziku. U broj riječi u datoteci nije važan , možete dodati neke ako želite ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:796
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remember that all words are nouns."
msgstr "Ne zaboravite da su sve riječi  imenice ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:801
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can then commit your files in <emphasis>l10n-kde4/&lt;lang_code&gt;/data/"
"kdeedu/khangman</emphasis>. Don't forget to update the CMakeLists.txt file "
"as well. Please contact me by email if you need further information. When "
"you send me the files, please don't forget to mention any <emphasis role="
"\"bold\">special characters</emphasis> used in your language (put them in a "
"text file, one per line and add this file in the tarball) and please mention "
"any other specificity."
msgstr ""
"Zatim možete uvrstiti svoje datoteke u  <emphasis>l10n-kde4/&lt;"
"lang_code&gt;/data/kdeedu/khangman</emphasis> . Ne zaboravite ažurirati "
"CMakeLists.txt datoteku. Molimo vas da me kontaktirate putem e-pošte , ako "
"su vam potrebne dodatne informacije . Kad mi pošaljete datoteke , molimo Vas "
"da ne zaboravite spomenuti  <emphasis role=\"bold\">specijalne znakove</"
"emphasis>  koriste u svom jeziku ( stavite ih u tekstualnu datoteku , jedan "
"po liniji i dodajte ovu datoteku u TAR arhive ) i molimo Vas da naglasite "
"bilo koje druge specifičnosti ."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:809
#, no-c-format
msgid "Please never commit files in a BRANCH as it might break the game."
msgstr ""
"Molimo vas da nikada ne počine datoteke u grani jer to može slomiti igru ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:813
#, no-c-format
msgid "Many thanks for your contribution!"
msgstr "Hvala puno za vaš doprinos !"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:817
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is stored by &khangman; and where"
msgstr "Šta je smjestio &khangman;  i gdje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:818
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you get a new language via <menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Get Words in New Language...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, the "
"new language data is stored in <filename class=\"directory\">$KDEHOME/share/"
"apps/kvtml/</filename> in the language code folder. The available language "
"dir names are also stored in the &khangman; config file in <filename>"
"$KDEHOME/share/config/khangmanrc</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Kada dobijete novi jezik preko  <menuchoice><guimenu>Igra</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem> Dobavi Riječi u Novom jeziku ... .</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> , novi podaci jezika se čuvaju u <filename class=\"directory\">"
"$KDEHOME/share/apps/kvtml/</filename> u direktoriju s šifrom jezika. "
"Dostupna imena jezičkih direktorija su također pohranjeni u &khangman; "
"config datoteci u <filename>$KDEHOME/share/config/khangmanrc</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:826
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The provider name (i.e. the address of the website where to download the new "
"languages) is stored in <filename>$KDEDIR/share/apps/khangman/khangmanrc</"
"filename>."
msgstr ""
"Ime usluga ( tj adresu web stranicu na kojoj preuzimanje novih jezika ) se "
"čuva u <filename>$KDEDIR/share/apps/khangman/khangmanrc</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:831
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The English language (default) and the user language from his i18n package"
"(s) (if available) are stored in <filename class=\"directory\">$KDEDIR/share/"
"apps/kvtml</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Na engleskom jeziku ( default ) i korisnik jezik iz 18n paketa ( s) ( ako je "
"dostupan ) čuvaju se u  <filename class=\"directory\">$KDEDIR/share/apps/"
"kvtml</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:836
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the configuration file, stored for each user in <filename>$KDEHOME/share/"
"config/khangmanrc</filename> are saved all the game settings such as the "
"background, last category played, ... plus the files that were downloaded "
"from the <guilabel>Get Hot New Stuff!</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"U datoteku konfiguracije , skladište za svakog korisnika u$ <filename>"
"$KDEHOME/share/config/khangmanrc</filename> čuvaju sve postavke igre , kao "
"što su pozadine , zadnja kategoriji igrao , ... plus datoteke koje su "
"preuzete iz <guilabel > Get Hot New Stuff ! </guilabel> dijalog ."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:846
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions and Answers"
msgstr "Pitanja i Odgovori"

#. Tag: chapter
#: index.docbook:846
#, no-c-format
msgid "&reporting.bugs; &updating.documentation;"
msgstr "&reporting.bugs; &updating.documentation;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:854
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have an error message telling me the pictures cannot be found."
msgstr "Imam poruku o grešci da mi se slike ne mogu naći ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:857
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game installs by default in <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/"
"kde</filename> so add <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/kde/bin</"
"filename> to your path and set the <envar>KDEDIR</envar> variable to "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/kde</filename> before running the "
"game. An easy way is to configure &khangman; with the option <option>--"
"prefix</option>=$<envar>KDEDIR</envar> where $<envar>KDEDIR</envar> is where "
"the rest of &kde; is installed. This could vary widely, depending on the "
"distribution and operating system you have. Better install &khangman; from "
"your distribution!"
msgstr ""
"Igra se normalno instalira u <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/kde</"
"filename>pa dodajte <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/kde/bin</"
"filename> u vašu stazu i postavite <envar>KDEDIR</envar> varijablu na "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/kde</filename> prije početka igre. "
"Lakši način da konfigurišete &khangman; sa opcijom <option>--prefix</option>="
"$<envar>KDEDIR</envar> gdje je $<envar>KDEDIR</envar> mjesto gdje je ostatak "
"&kde; instaliran. To može vrlo varirati, zavisno od distribucije i "
"operativnog sistema koje imate. Bolje instalirajte &khangman; iz vaše "
"distribucije!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:871
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&khangman; does not start correctly after I upgraded from an earlier version "
"to the &kde; 4 version"
msgstr ""
"&khangman; ne pravilno pokrenuti nakon što sam nadograditi na noviju verziju "
"za &kde; 4 version"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:875
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There might be a problem due to the change of the configuration file. Please "
"remove the <filename>khangmanrc</filename> file in your <filename class="
"\"directory\">$KDEHOME/share/config</filename> folder."
msgstr ""
"Tu bi mogao biti problem zbog promjene konfiguracijske datoteke . Molimo vas "
"da uklonite <filename>khangmanrc</filename> datoteku u <filename class="
"\"directory\">$KDEHOME/share/config</filename> direktoriju."

